        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, Cody Hanson, Cathal Coughlan\n- Music groups: Hinder, The Fatima Mansions, Microdisney\n- Songs: \"Get Stoned\"\n- Places: Oklahoma, Cork\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, Cathal Coughlan, a singer and keyboardist from Cork and formerly of Microdisney, formed the art rock group The Fatima Mansions.\n- In 2001, Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, and Cody Hanson formed the American rock band Hinder in Oklahoma.\n- \"Get Stoned\" is a song by the American rock band Hinder.",
